
Sunnyside Agency Landing Page

A responsive landing page for Sunnyside Agency, built as part of my frontend web development learning journey.

About the Project

This project is a creative agency landing page designed to showcase services, introduce the team through client testimonials, and display completed projects.

Built With

- HTML5
- CSS3
- CSS Grid
- Flexbox
- JavaScript

Features

- Responsive desktop and mobile layouts
- Navigation menu with a mobile hamburger button
- Services and feature sections
- Client testimonials
- Image gallery
- Social media links in the footer

What I Learned

Through this project, I practised:

- Structuring web pages with semantic HTML
- Creating responsive layouts with CSS Grid and Flexbox
- Using media queries for mobile responsiveness
- Working with images and background images
- Adding basic interactivity with JavaScript

Author

Created by me as part of my journey to becoming a frontend web developer.

